  "description": "She is a dazzling woman who commands the spotlight wherever she goes, always surrounded by men. It has been five years since Seo Ju-in became her friend—and for those same five years, he has harbored a secret, unrequited love for her. Even now, five years later, the sight of her with other men still makes his heart ache. Then, one night while out for drinks, she kisses him. What is she thinking? And who does she see when she looks at him?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
